WEBVTT

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:24.160
Lock opening code, please.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:40.190
Pet number confirmed. Retina check, please.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:48.670
Pet number Z-107M check, okay.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:26.870
Top floor.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:33.750
Why... does it have to be me?

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:41.590
Why would a Blondie from Tanagura want to put a mongrel on a leash so badly?

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:46.220
Don't ever come back here again.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:48.590
Guy...

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:07.810
This trade conference has brought us
truly significant results.

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:10.470
I'm grateful and delighted.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:11.250
Thank you.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:15.800
We too are always grateful for the federal government's

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:18.920
understanding and services. Thank you, Mr. Hazall.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.680
No need to thank us.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:24.200
We couldn't have finished
the conference this smoothly

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.600
without your help, Mr. Iason.

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:30.560
Your performance was splendid.
You impress me again and again.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:36.570
It seems we won't need to worry about Tanagura's prosperity in the future.

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:45.340
To have you, Mr. Hazall, a pillar of
the Federation, speak of me so highly

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.950
almost makes me
fear the consequences.

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:51.120
Anyway, as I'd expect from
an event sponsored by Parthea,

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:54.560
this is a really magnificent party.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:04:02.760
The food, the wine, <i>everything</i> here is literally top quality.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:08.690
Only the best for our VIP guests.
That is Jupiter's wish.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:12.490
If you have any desires, please don't hesitate.

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:16.810
I will do my best to see that you enjoy yourself to the fullest.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.320
Thank you very much.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.110
Excuse me.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:38.680
Iason.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.470
Is something wrong?

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:44.260
Nothing important.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.060
Not very convincing.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:50.310
You're sneaking out to attend to it,
even though you're the party's host.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:54.690
Still, you don't need
to sneak out too, Raoul.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:05:00.540
Don't mind me. I was getting fed up with the flattery and faked smiles.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.120
Will he really come?

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:15.080
He will... if there's been no mistake in our plan.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:21.630
If our information is correct,
he'll be driving his private car tonight.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:27.710
But don't you think it's too convenient
that a syndicate boss is using a private car

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:29.350
for official business?

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:33.980
It's like saying,
"Go ahead and shoot me."

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.310
He isn't human.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:38.770
He's a Blondie.
Our standards don't apply.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:44.240
Besides, we're in Parthea, which they believe is the safest area in their territory.

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.260
They won't have a strict guard here.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.120
He has no security around him.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:54.450
Who cares?

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:58.170
As long as we can blow
Iason Mink's head off.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.390
A shield!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.850
Shit. They've seen us.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:24.650
Dammit.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.940
You sure it was a good idea
to kill them all?

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:36.430
They're only small fry.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.500
We would hardly have gained any new information by capturing them.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.420
Those people will cut off
the lizard's tail.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:48.470
We cannot take action
without definite proof.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:53.440
But I will make sure
they pay for this.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.140
Iason.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.720
What is it?

00:06:56.720 --> 00:07:00.940
Your role in Tanagura's ruling syndicate is indispensable.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.900
You can't be easily replaced.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:09.490
Without you, Tanagura's whole structure will crumble.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:13.220
Listen. Don't even think about doing something

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:16.490
as stupid as taking on
an "Achilles' heel."

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.450
I've told you, Raoul.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:23.470
I don't intend to argue with you
about Riki anymore.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:28.340
As long as I perform my duties as a Blondie perfectly,

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:33.760
not even Jupiter has the right to interfere in my private life.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.530
Guy's running totally wild.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:08:00.240
Yeah, 'cause Riki's
disappeared again.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:04.020
If this keeps up, Bison is finished.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:06.890
In any case, we're on the blacklist.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:11.880
We're lucky just to be alive
after the Midas police got us.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:28.360
You idiot! You're provoking me.
You wanna die or what?!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:35.740
Hey, Luke, you go tell him.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:39.040
A cat's nine lives wouldn't be enough for him.

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:44.500
Guy, I understand how you feel,
but, well, don't overdo it.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.500
What would you know?!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.460
I...

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:49.920
Fuck!

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:57.970
Riki, have you really gone to that Blondie's place?

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:02.140
Abandoning me... us.

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:04.770
It's not like that.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:10.570
He... That bastard used dirty tricks to steal Riki away from us.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:13.940
That fucking Blondie.

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.940
How long are you going
to keep refusing?

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:52.780
I've told you, I won't let you off
unless you excite me a little more.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:58.730
I see. Then should I call Daryl again?

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:17.840
Spread your legs wider. I can't see it like that.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:22.360
A Pet's sexual activity is a public matter.
That's common sense.

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:27.690
As a Pet, you don't need
pride or shame.

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:54.560
You no longer have
a Pet ring to bind you.

00:11:55.290 --> 00:12:00.400
Go back to Ceres.
I will give you a year's freedom.

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:12.460
That was my last one.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.640
And I wasted it.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:30.270
You're here again. I heard that you didn't set foot outside again today.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:34.080
Where the hell am I supposed to go? To the salon?

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:39.600
A Pet from the slums. What's more, one who's far over twenty.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:42.130
I'm a living fossil here in Eos.

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:45.160
I'm fed up with being
part of a freak show.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.740
What great progress.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:51.160
Well, I don't mind either way,

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:56.120
as long as you are aware of the fact
that you are my Pet.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:02.160
Oh, cut the crap! You used
those dirty tricks to get me.

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:05.400
So don't give me this
"be aware" shit now!

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:07.430
Just don't forget.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:12.890
You are my Pet, Riki.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:19.440
As long as this Pet ring here bites into your flesh,

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.400
you are mine.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:26.570
No matter what anyone says or whom your heart is with.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:35.200
Curse you... really.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.880
You want me to use Riki in the black market?

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.640
Yes.

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:32.560
He used to work for you before.
Can you still use him?

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:38.140
Well, his skills earned him
the name of "Riki the Dark."

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:41.630
Once he has his touch back, it shouldn't be a problem.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.190
But are you sure?

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:49.050
The water in Eos doesn't seem to agree with a mongrel from the slums.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:53.140
He came to me, saying that he would suffocate here.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.160
Would you believe it?
<i>He</i> begged <i>me</i>.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:02.520
So if you can still use him,

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:05.170
I'm willing to loosen
his leash a bit more.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:09.220
The market is a double-edged sword.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:13.600
Rumors will multiply and spread like wildfire.

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:17.140
Are you sure you want to risk that?

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:21.360
It just means that an open secret will no longer be a secret.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:25.180
I will leave everything to you.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:28.280
As long as he doesn't break loose.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:33.490
Even if Riki's existence becomes your Achilles' heel?

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:38.150
It's still better than letting him suffocate in Eos.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:42.380
So you really... love him that much?

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:47.500
I'm counting on you, Katze.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:55.510
How about you, Riki?

00:15:56.220 --> 00:16:01.840
You've dragged a Tanagura Blondie down far enough to become a mere human.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.800
What will you do now?

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:18.340
Guy, I have no idea what you're up to, but just give it up.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:22.300
That's right. Riki's abandoned us.

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:27.170
They say he's living a life of luxury among Apatia's high society.

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.990
It's just rumors, though.

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:31.840
Apatia is

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:36.640
one of the few exclusive condominiums in Midas where you can keep Pets.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:41.100
We mongrels rarely get
the chance to rise up to that level.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:45.120
That bastard, he's hit the jackpot.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:49.070
Hey, Guy. Was Riki that good?

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:54.570
Don't talk big when you
don't know anything!

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.790
We mongrels created
such a huge scene.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:02.450
We weren't beaten to death but released right away.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:06.960
Do you guys really think
that we were just lucky?

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:10.300
You saying there was
more to it than that?

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:15.320
I'm saying someone crushed Bison

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:19.280
because he wanted
to get Riki so much.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:24.740
And in return for not
squeezing our necks,

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:27.840
he's now made Riki
into his toy in Apatia.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:34.440
Therefore, I'm gonna retrieve him!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.910
From... who?

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:38.990
From Tanagura's

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:40.950
Mr. Blondie!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:55.670
Hear that? "Tanagura's Mr. Blondie"?

00:17:55.670 --> 00:18:00.680
Riki left him twice.
That's made him go nuts.

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:05.600
Do you think he's serious about that?

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.770
Don't be stupid!

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:12.870
What can a mongrel from the slums do against the highest elite?

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:34.710
You incompetent moron.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:39.420
Stop making stupid excuses and gather the men already.

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:44.510
That idiot. It's not like he's new to the market.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:48.390
Seems like your cargo's not gonna arrive on time.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:51.310
We'll have to send someone
from this end.

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:54.730
I'll go. Daarsuo is just one day
from here by shuttle.

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.060
No, not you.

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:02.950
So he isn't extending
my leash that far, huh?

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.160
I'm glad you understand, Riki.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:09.080
Spares me wasting words.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.550
Here, go to the basement and do some work.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.380
I'm so grateful.

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:32.360
Everyone's so kind and
protective of me.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:33.980
Stop!

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:36.690
Stop, you scum!

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:39.740
Behave, will you!

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:43.720
There are millions of
fallen ex-Pets like you!

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:46.900
Those who disobey will have their arms and legs cut off

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:50.170
and join the freak show at Nanaya Uugo for the rest of their lives!

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:51.850
Enyuk?

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.140
How dare you cause me trouble.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:03.990
Even Pets who acted
all high and mighty in Eos

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:06.340
will be abandoned
when they grow old.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:10.770
Then, no matter whether they came from the Academy or some harem,

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:13.350
the only chances left for them are Midas' procurers,

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:16.320
or roaming until they land in hell.

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:22.820
The fate of a Pet is always more or less the same.

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:27.860
Riki, have you ever thought about

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:31.370
how lucky you are to live like this?

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:36.750
And how much of a risk Iason is taking for it?

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.340
Let me go, please.

00:22:22.340 --> 00:22:25.970
Not yet. I haven't had enough yet.

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:15.460
Iason, is it true that
you're in trouble...

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:17.040
because of me?

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:18.920
Who told you that?

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:20.920
There are rumors
about it everywhere.

00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:26.820
After all, I seem to be the rarest creature in the market.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:30.270
It's no laughing matter!

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:33.720
Oh, are you worried about me?

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:40.980
As if! I was just concerned
you might take me back to Eos.

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:45.860
You'd better improve your skills instead of worrying about that.

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:48.720
I'm not telling you
to become a hacker,

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:53.660
but at this rate, you'll always be just a rare creature.

00:25:14.360 --> 00:25:15.070
Guy?

00:25:31.880 --> 00:25:34.000
Katze? What is it?

00:25:36.590 --> 00:25:38.270
What? When?

00:25:41.010 --> 00:25:42.260
All right.

00:25:43.560 --> 00:25:46.910
No, you don't need to do anything.

00:25:47.310 --> 00:25:48.700
This is my problem.

00:25:49.230 --> 00:25:51.300
Is that understood, Katze?

00:26:07.210 --> 00:26:09.520
Don't tell me he's outside Tanagura.

00:26:10.420 --> 00:26:13.060
If so, where?

00:26:54.380 --> 00:26:56.600
Are you having problems?

00:26:57.130 --> 00:26:58.830
No, not really.

00:26:59.630 --> 00:27:04.420
It's unusual to see you
frowning like this.

00:27:09.100 --> 00:27:11.970
I hear Jupiter called you out.

00:27:14.570 --> 00:27:18.990
We know each other well enough,
so I'll be frank.

00:27:19.820 --> 00:27:23.450
There are unspoken rules, even for rule breaking.

00:27:24.280 --> 00:27:28.800
If you bull your way through and infuriate others, there will be a reaction.

00:27:29.210 --> 00:27:32.250
You mean because
I kept Riki in Apatia?

00:27:32.250 --> 00:27:36.300
As the head of the Syndicate, you need to maintain your charismatic image.

00:27:36.800 --> 00:27:42.470
A scandal with a Pet, a <i>mongrel</i> Pet,
is the lowest of the low.

00:27:43.680 --> 00:27:45.800
He said that too.

00:27:46.180 --> 00:27:49.430
That the name of Iason Mink would be blemished.

00:27:54.230 --> 00:27:57.400
Iason, keep this one thing in mind.

00:27:57.860 --> 00:28:03.570
I flatly refuse to be the one
who tampers with your mind.

00:28:32.810 --> 00:28:34.730
How do you feel?

00:28:37.150 --> 00:28:38.690
Just great, thanks.

00:28:38.690 --> 00:28:39.900
Thought so.

00:28:42.570 --> 00:28:44.200
Where are we?

00:28:45.030 --> 00:28:46.160
At Dana Bahn.

00:28:47.200 --> 00:28:49.290
Dana Bahn?

00:28:49.290 --> 00:28:53.500
The underground shelter
from the days of the revolution?

00:28:54.040 --> 00:28:58.080
It looks pretty run down,
but it's quite something.

00:28:58.080 --> 00:29:01.030
You can't easily find
a hideout like this.

00:29:01.030 --> 00:29:06.010
We'll soon be found.
The Pet ring has a tracer.

00:29:06.340 --> 00:29:09.320
It won't be of any use here.

00:29:10.060 --> 00:29:12.860
This place is shielded.

00:29:13.450 --> 00:29:16.940
I brought you here to learn
your true feelings.

00:29:16.940 --> 00:29:19.920
That really isn't the point anymore.

00:29:21.610 --> 00:29:23.600
It's been three years, Guy.

00:29:24.400 --> 00:29:27.770
You have no idea
what life as a Pet is like.

00:29:28.240 --> 00:29:34.300
I didn't have a clue myself
until I came back to the slums.

00:29:35.080 --> 00:29:38.920
It made me aware of the weight
of the past three years as his Pet.

00:29:40.130 --> 00:29:43.380
I'm already soaked
with Iason's poison.

00:29:43.380 --> 00:29:45.810
There's no way to get it out.

00:29:46.340 --> 00:29:49.600
The fact that I'm a Pet won't change,
no matter what.

00:29:49.930 --> 00:29:51.720
Just forget the whole thing.

00:29:52.060 --> 00:29:53.560
You don't understand!

00:29:54.480 --> 00:29:56.310
You really don't get it.

00:29:56.310 --> 00:30:01.190
Yeah, I don't want to understand your idiotic reasoning.

00:30:01.190 --> 00:30:03.540
What are you so afraid of?

00:30:04.240 --> 00:30:10.820
Are you okay with being kept
like this for the rest of your life?

00:30:14.700 --> 00:30:18.420
How long do I have to put up with this stupidity?!

00:30:19.020 --> 00:30:20.920
Until the storm blows over.

00:30:20.920 --> 00:30:24.300
It's never gonna blow over!

00:30:24.300 --> 00:30:25.840
Don't you get that?

00:30:25.840 --> 00:30:31.180
What you've done isn't just a simple punch in his face!

00:30:31.180 --> 00:30:34.220
You're pissing on a Blondie's pride!

00:30:34.560 --> 00:30:36.810
Look how confident you are.

00:30:36.810 --> 00:30:39.480
You're telling me a Blondie will get <i>that</i> furious

00:30:39.480 --> 00:30:41.940
just because I kidnapped his Pet?

00:30:49.160 --> 00:30:51.950
You really want to know
how I feel?

00:30:52.300 --> 00:30:56.870
Yeah, I do. I want a convincing answer that I can accept.

00:31:14.780 --> 00:31:18.380
I'll show you my true feelings!

00:31:18.380 --> 00:31:21.340
Open your eyes wide
and have a <i>good </i>look!

00:31:24.550 --> 00:31:26.230
Did you know?

00:31:26.920 --> 00:31:31.380
Caressing me here just lightly makes me hot.

00:31:32.070 --> 00:31:34.370
Here, and here too.

00:31:35.810 --> 00:31:38.350
He showed me all my good spots.

00:31:38.350 --> 00:31:42.300
As long as this ring's biting into my cock,
I get to do it with him.

00:31:42.300 --> 00:31:46.300
And you have no right
to wreck that!

00:31:47.050 --> 00:31:51.800
If you really care about Guy,
you'd better cut him off completely.

00:31:53.720 --> 00:31:56.310
So you're saying it's just me?

00:31:59.890 --> 00:32:03.690
Don't I even have the right
to feel for you anymore?

00:32:09.650 --> 00:32:13.570
Don't say that. Don't accuse me with that look in your eyes.

00:32:13.910 --> 00:32:17.710
That's right! I'll do as I please!

00:32:17.710 --> 00:32:19.740
Don't make me repeat myself!

00:32:19.740 --> 00:32:22.710
Why?! Are you choosing
him over me?

00:32:24.080 --> 00:32:27.420
I won't accept that.

00:32:27.880 --> 00:32:29.710
I will never, ever accept it!

00:32:34.930 --> 00:32:37.480
You were our leader.

00:32:37.480 --> 00:32:40.310
When we walked the streets, everyone would look at you.

00:32:41.080 --> 00:32:44.900
Can you imagine how proud I was to be with you?

00:32:44.900 --> 00:32:48.060
With you, I didn't fear anything.

00:32:48.650 --> 00:32:51.280
Riki, are you gonna destroy that?

00:32:51.280 --> 00:32:53.450
Can you really betray us all?

00:32:54.320 --> 00:32:57.580
I'm not telling you
to come back to Bison.

00:32:57.580 --> 00:33:00.640
Or even to me.

00:33:02.790 --> 00:33:08.100
Just... don't become his! Not him.

00:33:10.000 --> 00:33:15.380
I won't let you be his toy
for the rest of your life.

00:33:19.980 --> 00:33:23.120
And don't tell me
to stay out of this, Riki.

00:33:23.120 --> 00:33:26.350
He came and punched
my face first.

00:33:26.350 --> 00:33:28.310
So I won't just back down.

00:33:29.470 --> 00:33:32.580
So this thing is what keeps
you with him?

00:33:33.140 --> 00:33:36.070
Then why don't we just take it off?

00:33:48.630 --> 00:33:49.170
Riki?

00:33:53.300 --> 00:33:54.300
Who is this?

00:33:54.970 --> 00:33:55.940
Name yourself!

00:33:59.050 --> 00:34:02.120
You wouldn't know me
even if I told you.

00:34:02.930 --> 00:34:05.180
I'll return something
important to you.

00:34:05.560 --> 00:34:08.600
Wednesday, 15:00,
entrance to Dana Bahn.

00:34:09.650 --> 00:34:10.890
Got that?

00:36:22.740 --> 00:36:24.820
I see. I figured as much.

00:36:26.370 --> 00:36:29.810
Really, your idiocy is beyond help.

00:36:30.330 --> 00:36:31.770
Who's behind this?

00:36:32.670 --> 00:36:33.680
Is it Guy?

00:36:34.460 --> 00:36:37.140
How's Iason doing?

00:36:37.140 --> 00:36:39.950
Go ask him yourself.

00:36:39.950 --> 00:36:42.800
It's too late.
I can't see him anymore.

00:36:43.620 --> 00:36:45.850
I don't have time for your nonsense.

00:36:45.850 --> 00:36:47.450
Hurry up and get ready.

00:36:48.100 --> 00:36:50.500
I can't go back, Katze.

00:36:51.930 --> 00:36:55.810
I'm not a man anymore.

00:36:57.400 --> 00:36:59.980
I'm the same as you now.

00:37:00.740 --> 00:37:03.700
It was the only way
to get the Pet ring off.

00:37:04.700 --> 00:37:07.710
So I ended up paying
a painful penalty.

00:37:08.480 --> 00:37:13.370
That idiot. He's out of
his fucking mind!

00:37:15.550 --> 00:37:17.730
And where is that idiot now?

00:37:18.970 --> 00:37:21.210
Probably at Dana Bahn.

00:37:21.640 --> 00:37:24.800
The ring's tracer didn't work, right?

00:37:25.380 --> 00:37:27.720
We were hiding there
the whole time.

00:37:29.010 --> 00:37:32.740
He said something about getting leftover stuff from there.

00:37:33.850 --> 00:37:34.690
Can you walk?

00:37:35.190 --> 00:37:36.480
Just about.

00:37:36.480 --> 00:37:38.610
Then we'd better hurry.

00:37:38.610 --> 00:37:44.490
We'll catch him at Dana Bahn
to prevent further stupidities.

00:37:44.490 --> 00:37:46.380
The rest comes later.

00:37:47.100 --> 00:37:51.660
You called me here to lend you a hand, right?

00:37:52.080 --> 00:37:55.940
Thank you. I'll do the talking.

00:38:35.120 --> 00:38:38.100
I didn't think you'd come alone.

00:38:38.100 --> 00:38:40.580
Did your pride as a Blondie
demand that?

00:38:41.590 --> 00:38:43.540
I see. So it was you.

00:38:44.120 --> 00:38:45.610
Guy, was it?

00:38:46.220 --> 00:38:50.390
The old pairing partner playing the knight in shining armor?

00:38:53.350 --> 00:38:55.350
Follow me. Let's settle this.

00:39:41.600 --> 00:39:46.320
Don't tell me you've been confining Riki in a place like this.

00:39:46.820 --> 00:39:51.530
So you, a Tanagura elite Blondie, are sincerely worried about him?

00:39:51.950 --> 00:39:58.120
An owner doesn't need a reason
to care for his Pet.

00:39:58.620 --> 00:40:03.140
Iason, I bet you think I'm foolish.

00:40:03.710 --> 00:40:09.160
And that scum from Ceres like me are powerless against a Blondie like you.

00:40:10.510 --> 00:40:15.830
But you know, scum have
their pride as well.

00:40:15.830 --> 00:40:19.850
Once you've lost everything,
you become capable of <i>anything</i>.

00:40:19.850 --> 00:40:22.940
Even standing up to you.

00:40:22.940 --> 00:40:25.590
I applaud this fucking
courage of yours.

00:40:26.270 --> 00:40:28.070
Even though you annoy me.

00:40:28.450 --> 00:40:30.950
Right back at you.

00:40:30.950 --> 00:40:34.780
After all, you casually crushed Bison
until nothing remained.

00:40:35.280 --> 00:40:37.250
Enough small talk.

00:40:37.250 --> 00:40:40.750
Now... give Riki back to me.

00:40:41.370 --> 00:40:42.960
Where are you hiding him?

00:40:43.620 --> 00:40:46.420
Why do you think he's here?

00:40:48.880 --> 00:40:52.180
Oh, so it has a function
like that built-in.

00:40:52.850 --> 00:40:54.890
No wonder Riki's scared shitless.

00:40:55.460 --> 00:40:58.850
Give him back. He's my Pet.

00:41:03.480 --> 00:41:04.610
Take it!

00:41:21.160 --> 00:41:24.290
I've officially returned it to you.

00:41:25.250 --> 00:41:30.000
Now there's nothing to tie Riki down, except you!

00:41:31.130 --> 00:41:32.390
You freaking bastard,

00:41:33.840 --> 00:41:34.970
I'll slaughter you!

00:41:35.320 --> 00:41:38.950
That's my line. Double it
and back at you!

00:41:39.510 --> 00:41:43.600
I won't let you have Riki,
even if it's the last thing I do!

00:42:09.960 --> 00:42:11.250
Where is Riki?

00:42:33.740 --> 00:42:34.910
Guy.

00:43:01.020 --> 00:43:06.870
I won't let you have Riki, you bastard.
You're gonna go down here with me.

00:43:13.980 --> 00:43:15.280
Guy!

00:43:16.060 --> 00:43:17.930
You there? Guy?

00:43:38.970 --> 00:43:43.800
You're kidding me.
Why did you do that?!

00:43:43.800 --> 00:43:46.870
You promised not to harm him!

00:43:48.810 --> 00:43:51.230
You reap what you sow.

00:43:51.230 --> 00:43:52.600
Let's go, Riki.

00:43:52.980 --> 00:43:54.000
What is it?

00:43:54.610 --> 00:43:59.800
He's gone insane. There's no need to play along with his madness any further.

00:43:59.800 --> 00:44:01.780
Come on, Riki.

00:44:03.320 --> 00:44:07.940
Iason, please. I can't
leave him here like this.

00:44:07.940 --> 00:44:13.790
He isn't dead, right?
Then please save him.

00:44:16.860 --> 00:44:20.510
Do you really...
love him that much?

00:44:21.040 --> 00:44:22.760
That's not it!

00:44:22.760 --> 00:44:27.100
You and me, we drove
him to this, Iason!

00:44:27.640 --> 00:44:29.180
It might be fine for you,

00:44:29.680 --> 00:44:31.640
but if I abandon him here,

00:44:32.100 --> 00:44:35.180
that'd make me worse than scum.

00:44:35.180 --> 00:44:37.470
I can't live with that.

00:45:17.440 --> 00:45:18.650
Riki!

00:45:44.260 --> 00:45:45.340
Are you all right?

00:45:45.680 --> 00:45:48.010
Yeah, just about.

00:45:48.010 --> 00:45:49.380
Can you go on?

00:45:49.380 --> 00:45:51.120
I will, even if I have to crawl.

00:45:52.490 --> 00:45:56.310
What are you doing?
We have to hurry.

00:46:00.740 --> 00:46:05.360
Take Guy with you.
Time's running out.

00:46:58.750 --> 00:47:01.710
Riki! Get a grip, Riki!

00:47:02.050 --> 00:47:02.920
Riki!

00:47:02.920 --> 00:47:04.170
Hey, Riki!

00:47:06.470 --> 00:47:08.420
Help Guy.

00:47:08.420 --> 00:47:12.170
Hang in there.
Don't pass out now.

00:47:12.170 --> 00:47:16.300
I don't have time for that.
Inside there...

00:47:16.300 --> 00:47:19.580
Just let go. We'll talk later.

00:47:19.580 --> 00:47:23.650
Inside... Iason's still inside...

00:47:24.070 --> 00:47:25.970
Where? Why?

00:47:26.540 --> 00:47:33.280
Guy was planning to blow up the whole place with Iason and him inside.

00:47:33.280 --> 00:47:36.620
The explosion was too massive. He covered me and...

00:47:37.810 --> 00:47:40.240
He can't move anymore.

00:47:41.330 --> 00:47:43.470
And you just left him there?

00:47:57.770 --> 00:48:00.480
You no longer have
a Pet ring to bind you.

00:48:01.650 --> 00:48:04.330
I'll give you a year of freedom.

00:48:05.030 --> 00:48:07.940
I'll be waiting here.

00:48:08.860 --> 00:48:16.330
For the time, the moment,
when you will become truly mine.

00:48:38.720 --> 00:48:41.260
Riki. Why?

00:48:43.060 --> 00:48:45.910
Therefore, I'll go back.

00:48:45.910 --> 00:48:46.770
Are you serious?

00:48:47.520 --> 00:48:50.400
He tried to save Guy for my sake

00:48:50.400 --> 00:48:52.760
and protected me with his own body.

00:48:53.550 --> 00:48:55.740
That's enough reason to go back.

00:48:56.950 --> 00:48:59.240
I won't let him go on his own.

00:49:03.540 --> 00:49:04.830
These are "Black Moons."

00:49:05.670 --> 00:49:08.300
I always carry them with me on business, just in case.

00:49:09.280 --> 00:49:11.290
You'll feel relief soon
if you smoke it.

00:49:21.060 --> 00:49:23.770
You must be bored on your own,

00:49:23.770 --> 00:49:26.900
so I thought you might want someone to talk to.

00:49:26.900 --> 00:49:29.440
If I talk too much,
just tell me and I'll shut up.

00:49:29.920 --> 00:49:32.840
Fawning at someone's feet
is not my thing,

00:49:32.840 --> 00:49:36.450
but I can do as much as
curling up and lying still.

00:49:51.130 --> 00:49:52.550
You want one?

00:49:52.550 --> 00:49:53.580
Yeah.

00:49:54.590 --> 00:49:58.800
Having a last smoke with you doesn't sound too bad.

00:50:07.600 --> 00:50:13.900
This will be our last deep kiss.

00:52:20.030 --> 00:52:24.660
Humans need to support each other in some kind of way, in order to live.

00:52:26.150 --> 00:52:28.870
Regardless of who supports whom.

00:52:30.400 --> 00:52:34.830
I don't fully understand, but conflict
was the binder for their relationship.

00:52:36.660 --> 00:52:39.770
I suppose those kinds of encounters exist too.

00:52:41.680 --> 00:52:43.260
A Master and his Pet...

00:52:44.930 --> 00:52:47.800
You may not want to hear it,

00:52:47.800 --> 00:52:52.640
but I guess some kinds of love can only be fulfilled when it ends this way.

00:52:54.650 --> 00:52:56.310
I'll try to think about it.

00:52:58.400 --> 00:53:01.490
About the weight of this lost arm.

00:53:02.200 --> 00:53:05.350
Apparently, I'll have more than enough time for that.

00:53:06.280 --> 00:53:07.400
Riki...
